<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: DCC says now owns 50 pct of Allied Foods.</title>
<headline>DCC says now owns 50 pct of Allied Foods.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial holding company DCC Plc said on Thursday that it now owns 50 percent of Allied Foods, the leading independent distributor of chilled and frozen foods in the Republic of Ireland.</p>
<p>DCC said in a statement that it had acquired 50 percent of Millais Investments Ltd which in turn has acquired Allied Foods Ltd. Allied management holds the remaining 50 percent of Millais.</p>
</text>
